{{Quote|Princess, we have a visitor. We've picked up something outside the base in Zone Twelve, moving east.|General Carlist Rieekan, to Princess [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]]|<ref name="ESB" />}}
'''Zone Twelve''' was the designation given by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] to an area of land beyond the Alliance headquarters of [[Echo Base]] on the [[Water|ice]] [[planet]] [[Hoth]]. Echo [[Station 3-8]] was located near Zone Twelve. The [[Viper probe droid]] [[XJ9-CS14]] also moved through this area.<ref name="ESB" />

